{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"meng-wulin","title":"吕蒙与周瑜等破曹于乌林","order":9684,"accounts":[{"id":"meng-wulin-account-1","label":"记载","text":"《吕蒙传》以“是岁”记吕蒙与周瑜、程普等西破曹公于乌林。这是相关战事的另一份记载，不另计为一场战争。","evidence":["meng-wulin"]},{"id":"chenghuang-a-5944c0c6a2e38fef5411","label":"正文","text":"普与周瑜为左右督破曹公于乌林走曹仁","evidence":["chenghuang-q-4899fb2254b87356d5bf"]},{"id":"chenghuang-a-2226c5e0e14156faf2c1","label":"正文","text":"泰与周瑜程普拒曹公于赤壁攻曹仁于南郡","evidence":["chenghuang-q-71118457ea2362bab9bf"]},{"id":"chenghuang-a-826f553c3fd4898205e5","label":"正文","text":"宁随瑜破曹乌林攻曹仁南郡未拔","evidence":["chenghuang-q-9fe204f6acf97427eddb"]},{"id":"chenghuang-a-68961bbba4529a00eddb","label":"正文","text":"统与周瑜等破曹乌林攻曹仁迁校尉","evidence":["chenghuang-q-5b7906ed2c7bfc57de04"]}],"participants":[{"person":"lu-meng","role":"参与破曹","evidence":["meng-identity","meng-context","meng-wulin"]},{"person":"zhou-yu","role":"共同破曹","evidence":["meng-wulin"]},{"person":"cheng-pu","role":"共同破曹","evidence":["meng-wulin"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"被击败一方","evidence":["meng-wulin"]},{"person":"cao-ren","role":"南郡被走者；被攻于南郡者；南郡被攻者","evidence":["chenghuang-q-4899fb2254b87356d5bf","chenghuang-q-71118457ea2362bab9bf","chenghuang-q-9fe204f6acf97427eddb","chenghuang-q-5b7906ed2c7bfc57de04"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0004","role":"与周瑜程普拒曹公于赤壁、攻曹仁于南郡、荆州平定将兵屯岑","evidence":["chenghuang-q-71118457ea2362bab9bf"]},{"person":"gan-ning","role":"随周瑜拒破曹公于乌林、攻曹仁于南郡未拔","evidence":["chenghuang-q-9fe204f6acf97427eddb"]},{"person":"ling-tong","role":"为承烈都尉、与周瑜等拒破曹公于乌林、遂攻曹仁、迁为校尉","evidence":["chenghuang-q-5b7906ed2c7bfc57de04"]}],"place":{"text":"乌林","evidence":["meng-wulin"]},"time":{"label":"同年（承接征黄祖记事）","precision":"relative","basis":"原文以“是岁”承接本段征黄祖记事，保留这一相对时间表达。","relative":"承接本段征黄祖记事","evidence":["meng-context","meng-wulin"]}}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"cao-ren","name":"曹仁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"cheng-pu","name":"程普","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"gan-ning","name":"甘宁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"ling-tong","name":"凌统","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"lu-meng","name":"吕蒙","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0004","name":"周泰","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhou-yu","name":"周瑜","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-4899fb2254b87356d5bf","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-c5f772779d9533db571b","layer":"original","quote":"与周瑜为左、右督，破曹公于乌林；又进攻南郡，走曹仁","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":58,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-5b7906ed2c7bfc57de04","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-c99c878bab695f17a1b1","layer":"original","quote":"权以统为承烈都尉〖12〗。与周瑜等拒破曹公于乌林，遂攻曹仁。迁为校尉","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":270,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-71118457ea2362bab9bf","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-2b92a0aa789685989e6a","layer":"original","quote":"后与周瑜、程普拒曹公于赤壁，攻曹仁于南郡。荆州平定，将兵屯岑","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-9fe204f6acf97427eddb","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-eec0a15bbfd2de6b4e09","layer":"original","quote":"后随周瑜，拒破曹公于乌林。攻曹仁于南郡，未拔","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":226,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"meng-context","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c5dafa5a24682c296ffa","quote":"从征黄祖，祖令都督陈就，逆以水军出战。蒙勒前锋〖15〗，亲枭就首；将士乘胜，进攻其城。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"meng-identity","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-09ad3b8bc938115b5986","quote":"吕蒙字子明，汝南富陂人也〖1〗。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":312,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"meng-wulin","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c5dafa5a24682c296ffa","quote":"是岁，又与周瑜、程普等，西破曹公于乌林，围曹仁于南郡。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":91,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
